### Agent instructions ###
# CLAUDE.md is this repository's briefing for Claude Code: it is working notes about the project's
# invariants, not part of the project. Keeping it out of the tree means a clone of the public repo
# carries the code and the guides and nothing about how it gets worked on. It stays on disk — it is
# only untracked — so editing it still takes effect locally.
CLAUDE.md
